§§ `contract of service, workman, employee, employer, dismiss`

-- Arguments: an agreement, written or oral, express or implied; one person agrees to employ another as an employee; that other agrees to serve as an employee; an apprenticeship contract or agreement.
-- src:412 | “contract of service” means any agreement, whether written or
-- src:413 | oral, express or implied, whereby one person agrees to
